            "sid": "1PE 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abako doga bot ludoŋo ma gitye i kinwu, an ma ladit wadiwu ma abedo caden i can pa Kricito, dok bene abiribbe kwedwu i deyone ma binen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.21.15+JHN.21.16+JHN.21.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jon 21.15-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wukwa romi pa Lubaŋa ma tye botwu, kun wunenogi maber, pe pi dic, ento pi mitiwu kenwu, i kit ma Lubaŋa mito, pe pi lim, ento pi mit me cwinywu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pe wulo dano ma giketo i ciŋwu ki tek, ento wubed lanen maber bot romi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "miyo ka Lakwat madit binen, wun wubinoŋo mot, lalukana me deyo ma pe balle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.3.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Car 3.34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kit meno, wun awobe bene, wuwiny loc pa ludoŋo. Wun ducu wurukke ki mwolo, ŋat acel acel i nyim lawote, pien “Lubaŋa pyem ki jo ma wakke, ento miyo kica bot jo mamwol.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
